{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "english", "appid": 548430, "month": "2020-07", "window": 2, "start_date": 1594252800, "end_date": 1594857599, "month_true_total": 2110, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:21:25 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "72758729", "author": {"steamid": "76561198298410446", "personaname": "B", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198298410446/", "num_games_owned": 209, "num_reviews": 26, "playtime_forever": 417747, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 2080, "playtime_at_review": 9530, "last_played": 1787953822, "avatar": "1d3bf709a75a825644ae68443e1b2cd0be802ccc"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game 9/10. With more updates and content that gets added, the better this game gets. These Devs know what they are doing. The updates are not frequent but i have always felt they were a solid corner stone of content. Not a pay 2 win game. Takes about 5-10 hrs to get a character to the first promotion so you can Deep Dive (If you rush it). Mission difficulties seem well balanced once you can get a few different weapons and builds for those weapons. Pros and Cons Later since IDK where my 1500 hr review went.. w/e. Cheers Ghostship for a great game! This game is a standard in what qualities needs to be in a modern game.", "timestamp_created": 1594856311, "timestamp_updated": 1705310697, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.525691688060760498", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "72754583", "author": {"steamid": "76561198058846919", "personaname": "Lumi.mom", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/LumiWhitmayne/", "num_games_owned": 554, "num_reviews": 35, "playtime_forever": 25384, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5032, "last_played": 1782524829, "avatar": "b618dde534b509a7135a11633908f4cd77e5cd65"}, "language": "english", "review": "My friends and I have played games like Left 4 Dead, Monaco, and Minecraft Super Hostile maps, and Deep Rock Galactic perfects everything we love about those games. Fun co-op shooting, mining and exploration, destructible terrain shenanigans, and the ability to either all play together for hours or have just a couple of us sit down for a quick session without worrying about getting ahead of everyone else. ROCK AND STONE TO THE BONE!", "timestamp_created": 1594849397, "timestamp_updated": 1594849397, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "72754037", "author": {"steamid": "76561198051886043", "personaname": "Barboozaa", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/barboozaa/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 9041, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4894, "last_played": 1776057172, "avatar": "7fedb413dabf24a1a51013d86b9ae0696ae332c3"}, "language": "english", "review": "Love Too Play Dwarf Rock Game", "timestamp_created": 1594848633, "timestamp_updated": 1594848633, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.54356849193572998", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "72753241", "author": {"steamid": "76561198978286470", "personaname": "Groudon", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/p